# 𝙈𝘼𝙍𝙆𝘾𝙋𝙈1𝙏𝙊𝙊𝙋𝙎

CPM1 + CPM2 (Maintenance) Bot with Subscription & Coin System

## Features
- CPM1: Clone, Unlock Cars, W16, Horns, Fuel, Damage, Smoke, Rank, Fix, ID/Email/Pass change, Money/Coins, Animations, Wheels, Houses, Equipments, Ultimate Unlock.
- CPM2: Under Maintenance.
- Subscription (Stars / Money) + Coin System (50/100/250 per feature).
- Admin Panel, Logs, Backup, Dashboard.
